<h1>This page</h1>

<p>
  <strong>adrianpadilla.net</strong> is my personal homepage. It exists so that
  there is one address on the web that is mine, independent of any platform that
  might change its terms or disappear.
</p>

<p>
  It is intentionally small. What lives here is whatever I want to keep at a
  stable address and hand to someone as a link.
</p>

<p>
  It is static HTML built with <a href="https://www.11ty.dev/">Eleventy</a> and
  served as plain files. Everything on it works with JavaScript turned off;
  the only script on the page remembers whether you asked for the light or dark
  theme.
</p>
